        "description": "A chilling moment between Friends ? Or maybe a hilarious session with power items? Perfect you’re at the right place in Badminton Time!\n\n1. Start your adventure in customizing your avatar : sports & funky outfits, glasses, hats, rackets, ...\n\n2. Discover all the game modes: \n- In realistic gameplay, the game delivers top-notch simulation physics like in the real world\n- In arcade gameplay, you use power items to drive your opponent crazy!\n- In mini games, you will discover 5 different mini-games to show who is the king!\n- In training, you can participate in different sessions to improve your skills.\n\n3. Travel the world to discover incredible places : Grand canyon, Japanese garden, North pole, Snowy forest, Paradise island, ...\n\n4. Don't forget you can play alone, against AI and with humans. Up to 4 in the same match or mini game! So be ready for matchmaking or to invite your friends to join your party!",
